{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What is the definition of solar energy?\",\n  \"total_results\": 8,\n  \"search_time\": 0.454,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solar_energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar energy is the radiant energy from the Sun's light and heat, which can be harnessed using a range of technologies such as solar electricity, solar thermal ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"en.wikipedia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 9,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy – SEIA\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seia.org/initiatives/about-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar power is energy from the sun that is converted into thermal or electrical energy. Solar energy is the cleanest and most abundant renewable energy source ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"seia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy - National Geographic Education\",\n      \"url\": \"https://education.nationalgeographic.org/resource/solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar energy is any type of energy generated by the sun. Solar energy can be harnessed directly or indirectly for human use. These solar panels, ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"education.nationalgeographic.org\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Apr 3, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar energy | Definition, Uses, Examples, Advantages, & ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.britannica.com/science/solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar energy is radiation from the Sun that is capable of producing heat, causing chemical reactions, or generating electricity.\",\n      \"domain\": \"britannica.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Sep 9, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar power 101: What is solar energy?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.energysage.com/about-clean-energy/solar/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar power is usable energy generated from the sun with solar panels. It is a clean, inexpensive, and renewable power source available ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"energysage.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Aug 6, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Advantages and Disadvantages of Solar Energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.constellation.com/energy-101/energy-innovation/solar-energy-pros-and-cons.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar is a renewable energy source that can power your home and help reduce your electricity costs. Learn the pros and cons of solar energy.\",\n      \"domain\": \"constellation.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How does solar power work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationalgrid.com/stories/energy-explained/how-does-solar-power-work\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar power works by converting energy from the sun into power. There are two forms of energy generated from the sun for our use – electricity and heat.\",\n      \"domain\": \"nationalgrid.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 16, 2023\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What is solar energy?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.engie.com/en/activities/renewable-energies/solar-energy/solar-energy-definition\",\n      \"snippet\": \"It is the energy generated by solar radiation. The nuclear fusion that occurs on a massive scale in the Sun releases incredible quantities of heat and light.\",\n      \"domain\": \"engie.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Jul 25, 2022\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What is the definition of solar energy? definition\",\n    \"What is the definition of solar energy? examples\",\n    \"What is the definition of solar energy? 2024\",\n    \"What is the definition of solar energy? research\",\n    \"What is the definition of solar energy? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:32:09"}
