{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies?\",\n  \"total_results\": 9,\n  \"search_time\": 1.61,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy Basics\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/research/re-solar\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The most commonly used solar technologies are solar photovoltaics for electricity, passive solar design for space heating and cooling, and solar ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"nrel.gov\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Aug 27, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 9,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How Does Solar Work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/solar/how-does-solar-work\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are two main types of solar energy technologies—photovoltaics (PV) and concentrating solar-thermal power (CSP). Photovoltaics Basics.\",\n      \"domain\": \"energy.gov\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Dec 3, 2019\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 9,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy – SEIA\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seia.org/initiatives/about-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"While solar is comprised of a diverse suite of technologies, there are three main types: photovoltaics (PV), solar heating & cooling (SHC), and concentrating ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"seia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What is solar energy? Types and main advantages\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.repsol.com/en/energy-move-forward/energy/solar-energy/index.cshtml\",\n      \"snippet\": \"What is solar energy? · Photovoltaic solar energy · Thermal solar energy · Passive solar energy · Hybrid solar energy.\",\n      \"domain\": \"repsol.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar technology guide: Panels to cells\",\n      \"url\": \"https://poweroutage.us/solar/solar-technology\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Key takeaways. Monocrystalline, polycrystalline, and thin-film solar panels are each designed to perform best under specific conditions.\",\n      \"domain\": \"poweroutage.us\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 5, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Two Types of Solar Energy.\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.planete-energies.com/en/media/article/two-types-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The Two Types of Solar Energy. · Photovoltaic Solar Power · Low-Temperature Solar Thermal Power · Concentrated Solar Power.\",\n      \"domain\": \"planete-energies.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 2, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Exploring the 5 Main Types of Solar Energy: PV, STE, CSP ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.saurenergy.com/solar-energy-blog/exploring-the-5-main-types-of-solar-energy-pv-ste-csp-passive-solar-bipv\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The 5 main types of solar energy are Solar Photovoltaic, Solar Thermal Energy, Concentrated Solar Power, Passive Solar Energy, and BIPV.\",\n      \"domain\": \"saurenergy.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 6, 2023\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What Are the Different Types of Solar Energy?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://solartogether.co.uk/blog/what-are-the-different-types-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are three main types of solar energy: photovoltaic (PV), solar thermal, and passive solar gain. PV panels use the sun's light to generate electricity, ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"solartogether.co.uk\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The 3 Different Types of Solar Power Systems Explained\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gogreensolar.com/pages/solar-system-types\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are three basic types of solar power systems: grid-tie, off-grid, and backup power systems. Here's a quick summary of the differences between them.\",\n      \"domain\": \"gogreensolar.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies? definition\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies? examples\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies? 2024\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies? research\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy technologies? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:32:24"}
