{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy?\",\n  \"total_results\": 9,\n  \"search_time\": 1.543,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar explained Solar energy and the environment\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.eia.gov/energyexplained/solar/solar-energy-and-the-environment.php\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Some solar thermal systems use potentially hazardous fluids to transfer heat, and leaks of these materials could be harmful to the environment.\",\n      \"domain\": \"eia.gov\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Jan 19, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 9,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Scaling Solar for a Renewable Energy Future\",\n      \"url\": \"https://business.columbia.edu/insights/climate/CKI-solar-four-key-points\",\n      \"snippet\": \"1. Solar energy is cheap and getting even cheaper. · 2. Counterintuitively, the low price of solar may present hurdles to its growth. · 3. Solar ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"business.columbia.edu\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Oct 4, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 8,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Dark Side of Solar Power\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hbr.org/2021/06/the-dark-side-of-solar-power\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The High Cost of Solar Trash. The industry's current circular capacity is woefully unprepared for the deluge of waste that is likely to come.\",\n      \"domain\": \"hbr.org\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Jun 18, 2021\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar power problems & solutions\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pvcase.com/blog/solar-power-pros-and-cons\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar power problems include limited conversion efficiency, intermittency, geographic variations, high initial costs, and land use concerns.\",\n      \"domain\": \"pvcase.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Challenges of Solar Energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.fuergy.com/blog/the-challenges-of-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar challenges include a \\\"duck curve\\\" mismatch, environmental costs of production, and the large space required for solar plants.\",\n      \"domain\": \"fuergy.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Top Challenges Solar Energy Faces in 2024 and ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://tamesol.com/solar-2024-challenges/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The Top Challenges Solar Energy Faces in 2024 and Beyond · 1. Economic and Financial Barriers · 2. Technological Advancements and Efficiency · 3.\",\n      \"domain\": \"tamesol.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 10, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Advantages and Disadvantages of Solar Energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.constellation.com/energy-101/energy-innovation/solar-energy-pros-and-cons.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Disadvantages of Solar Energy · 1. The high initial costs of installing panels · 2. Solar energy storage is expensive · 3. Solar doesn't work for every roof type.\",\n      \"domain\": \"constellation.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Challenges Facing The Solar Industry Right Now\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dataforma.com/challenges-facing-the-solar-industry-right-now/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The solar industry faces challenges in efficiency, reliability, environmental impacts, and reliance on changing government policies.\",\n      \"domain\": \"dataforma.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar power: the benefits, the challenges and the future\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.hitachienergy.com/us/en/news-and-events/blogs/2023/11/solar-power-the-benefits-the-challenges-and-the-future\",\n      \"snippet\": \"And what are the challenges with solar power? By far the biggest challenge is its intermittency; the sun doesn't 'shine' for 24 hours a day.\",\n      \"domain\": \"hitachienergy.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Nov 9, 2023\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy? definition\",\n    \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy? examples\",\n    \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy? 2024\",\n    \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy? research\",\n    \"What are the challenges associated with solar energy? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:34:10"}
