{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally?\",\n  \"total_results\": 9,\n  \"search_time\": 3.442,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Global Market Outlook for Solar Power 2025-2029\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.solarpowereurope.org/insights/outlooks/global-market-outlook-for-solar-power-2025-2029/detail\",\n      \"snippet\": \"We anticipate a 10% increase in installations to 655 GW in 2025, with annual growth rates remaining in the low double digits between 2027-2029, reaching 930 GW ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"solarpowereurope.org\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 6, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar PV\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.iea.org/energy-system/renewables/solar-pv\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Power generation from solar PV increased by a record 320 TWh in 2023, up by 25% on 2022. Solar PV accounted for 5.4% of total global electricity generation, and ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"iea.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Global Electricity Review 2025 - Ember\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ember-energy.org/latest-insights/global-electricity-review-2025/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Record renewables growth led by solar helped push clean power past 40% of global electricity in 2024, but heatwave-related demand spikes led ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"ember-energy.org\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Apr 8, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Industry Research Data – SEIA\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seia.org/research-resources/solar-industry-research-data/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar has been the predominant new generating capacity to the grid every year since 2021. Solar continued to lead the energy transition in Q1 2025, representing ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"seia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Emerging Trends in Solar Energy: A Global Industry ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sunbasedata.com/blog/emerging-trends-in-solar-energy-a-global-perspective\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Explore key trends in solar energy, from advanced technologies and grid integration to global market growth and financing solutions shaping ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"sunbasedata.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Dec 14, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"2025 Renewable Energy Industry Outlook\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/industry/renewable-energy/renewable-energy-industry-outlook.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar was the only primary source of generation that recorded capacity growth, which jumped 88% to 18.6 gigawatts (GW). · Wind capacity additions ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"deloitte.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Dec 9, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy Trends: Data on the Evolution of ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://conexsol.com/optimize-your-energy-strategies-to-reduce-peak-demand-and-cut-costs/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"1. The Cost of Solar Energy Has Dropped by 89% Since 2010 · 2. Solar Panel Efficiency Has Increased from 15% to Over 22% · 3. Global Solar ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"conexsol.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 13, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Future of Solar Energy: Solar Energy Trends 2025\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arka360.com/ros/future-of-solar-energy-predictions\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The future of solar energy is set for exceptional growth as advancements in technology, increased investments, and strong policy support continue to push ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"arka360.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar energy status in the world: A comprehensive review\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352484723014579\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Although there has been a significant increase of approximately 22% in global solar energy installed capacity between 2021 and 2022, the literature survey ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"sciencedirect.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally? definition\",\n    \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally? examples\",\n    \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally? 2024\",\n    \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally? research\",\n    \"What are the current trends in solar energy adoption globally? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:35:23"}
