ntal impacts like water usage, possibly hazardous waste, land use, landscape fragmentation, ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"sciencedirect.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Environmental Impact of Solar Energy: Is It Truly Worth ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.greenfi.com/resources/the-environmental-impact-of-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"What are the potential negative environmental impacts of solar energy? · Habitat Loss · Ecosystem Disruption · Water Use · Exposure to hazardous ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"greenfi.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 11, 2022\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What is the environmental impact of solar energy? definition\",\n    \"What is the environmental impact of solar energy? examples\",\n    \"What is the environmental impact of solar energy? 2024\",\n    \"What is the environmental impact of solar energy? research\",\n    \"What is the environmental impact of solar energy? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:36:13"}
